                    exception of those indicating omission of unrelated material, are in the
                    original, which does not indicate the time of the meeting or where in Belgrade
                    the meeting took place. President Ford was visiting Yugoslavia from August 3 to
                    4. (Ford Library, President’s Daily Diary)</p>
            </note>
